      "description": [
        "Grow wheat first. Combine compost, wheat seed and oak leaves for your first sugar cane. The wooden greenhouse retains one starter and produces three cane per 250 mB water. Paper unlocks the native MI rubber route.",
        "Kelp starter: compost + wheat seed + water bucket (bucket returned). Cactus: sand + compost + wheat seed. Beetroot seed: compost + wheat seed + red dye. All are retained greenhouse starters."
      ],
      "tasks": [
