    {
      "id": "5E50000000000002",
      "title": "Spawner Programs",
      "icon": {
        "id": "minecraft:slime_ball",
        "count": 1
      },
      "x": 3.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "shape": "circle",
      "dependencies": [],
      "description": [
        "Craft a vanilla mob egg with its recipe, then surround that egg with eight Iron Bars to craft a mob-specific vanilla Spawner. Insert the Spawner into the controller slot; it is retained, not consumed. The decorative filter no longer cycles species.",
        "Wooden harvesters accept Zombie, Skeleton, Spider, Cow and Slime programs. Steel adds Blaze, Enderman, Magma Cube, Ghast, Shulker and Wither Skeleton. Shulker and Wither Skeleton still need a retained Netherite Ingot in the hatch. Eggs are recipe ingredients and cannot directly spawn mobs or change a spawner. Placed spawners are disabled and never spawn mobs.",
        "Standard Spawners take 240 seconds per cycle in every compatible machine. Upgrade one with seven MI Steel Plates and one Electronic Circuit to a Reinforced Spawner: 60 seconds per cycle, Steel Harvester required. Advanced Spawners upgrade Reinforced with six Stainless Steel Plates and two Analog Circuits: 20 seconds per cycle, reserved for a future electric harvester. The chosen mob is preserved. Older tiers remain usable at their own speed; upgrading does not unlock extra species."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5E50000000100002",
          "type": "item",
          "item": {
            "id": "minecraft:slime_ball",
            "count": 1
