        "5E50000000000019"
      ],
      "description": [
        "Before the first hull, make Redstone Batteries with the copper/zinc starter recipe shown in EMI; native battery alloy is also available from mechanical Steel Drill lead and antimony.",
        "Hand-craft the LV Steam Turbine from a basic hull, circuit, two motors, two tin rotors, pipes and a tin cable. Feed steam from your existing steam infrastructure.",
        "Connect turbine -> tin cable -> electric machine. EU powers machines; the Basic Power Converter changes energy format and generates no power. Create New Age has an optional steel-gated magnetite crafting route.",
        "Next: open Chapter 5: The LV Factory for power distribution, component automation, the Electric Blast Furnace and your first aluminum."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5E5000000010000A",
          "type": "item",
