      "description": [
        "Search, sort and browse the shared item list. Click extracts a stack, right-click half a stack, shift-click withdraws to inventory, and shift-clicking your inventory deposits it. @mod filters by mod ID.",
        "Use the persistent 3 x 3 grid or EMI recipe + to fill it from the network and inventory; shift-click + requests multiple crafts. Shift-click the result for repeated crafting. Depleted grid slots refill from storage.",
        "Wind the spring with the Wind button or shift-right-click the block. One craft costs one charge. Adjacent spinning Create shafts recharge the spring at 16 RPM or more. Hoppers access the network."
