        "Feed SEAWATER from the sediment-processing Mixer into the left hatch, and 16 EU/t into the rear energy hatch. After 20 powered seconds, 1000 mB seawater becomes 1000 mB concentrated salt water. Extract it on the right. Plain water and raw drill sediment are rejected.",
        "No starting salt is needed. The retained geode core uses cobblestone, quartz and redstone. Power loss, blocked output or an incomplete shell holds the current growth/harvest pose."
