      "description": [
        "Vanilla ocean water is the same fluid as ordinary water; the pack adds seawater as a distinct processed fluid. No ocean-biome search or salt ingredient is required.",
        "Keep the Steel Drill supplied with ordinary cooling water. Its native MI output hatch supplies sediment-laden water. Feed 1000 mB into the native electric MI Mixer: 8 EU/t for 200 base recipe ticks produces 1000 mB seawater.",
        "Collect a bucket to commission the route, then pipe the Mixer output directly to the Salt Geode Chamber. Raw fluid sediment is not the item Mineral Sludge; do not spend your gem sludge here."
