      "description": [
        "An optional HV upgrade: craft the Digital Drill with two Highly Advanced Machine Hulls, two Advanced Motors, two Digital Circuits, two Titanium Plates and an Electric Drill. This is a 1x1 machine, powered at 512 EU/t. Existing retained survey core requirements still apply.",
        "Open Sides for an Iron Furnaces-style six-face layout. Click each absolute world face to cycle Off, blue Item Input, orange Item Output and yellow Energy Input. These settings persist and the world model shows coloured MI hatch textures. Defaults: top input, bottom output, south energy.",
        "Geological programs produce one Dry Drill Sediment alongside each ore/sludge output. Both outputs must have room before work starts. This drill uses no cooling water and has no sediment fluid outlet.",
        "Mix one Dry Drill Sediment with 1000 mB ordinary water in the native MI Mixer (32 EU/t, 200 base ticks) to obtain 1000 mB Excellent Sediment Water. Dilute that into seawater as usual. The Glacial Ice bucket program produces no sediment."
